  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Limited edition of 24 copies, signed and numbered by the artist.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"You, too, can be an enabling co-dependent. Just colour far more clothes and accessories than Affluenza can use. Three custom-wrapped crayons are provided, but feel free to use any crayons or colored pencils that you might already have. If you are truly committed to making sure that Affluenza has far more than she (or anyone) needs, pages from the book provided may be photocopied as desired"--Colophon.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">A tin box with title sticker attached to lid, decorated with commercial brand logos. Colophon sticker, signed and numbered in pencil, is attached to the bottom of the tin. Contents include a paper doll kit (one sheet for the doll, seven folded sheets of clothing and accessories, held together with a paper belly band), three custom-wrapped crayons, a sticker with the title, and a long sheet printed with an alphabet poem, folded to resemble a retail receipt.</subfield>
  </datafield>
